* A PC-relative reference to a global label made by a macro argument: r68 resolves it; ours
* kept a relocation (no twin for such a label), which links the same. The pre-scan now notes the
* global labels macro calls make (a bne.s to one before the call was "too large").
* fixed: 88d366c 2026-10-11 r68togas: twins for the global labels macro calls make
* expect text: 6006 4e71 41fa 0002 6f6e6500
 psect macro_label_pcrel,0,0,0,0,0
DEFS macro
_S\1: dc.b "\1",0
 endm
 bra.s _Sone
 nop
 lea _Sone(pc),a0
 DEFS one
 ends
